{"time": 1772678502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106005927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那相当于我们浪费了一次埋伏的必杀机会啊。”"}
{"time": 1772678525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850600424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“要是来的是一个上位猎人小队，说不定永绝后患了。”"}
{"time": 1772678537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331085919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=130230650]训练场内的后勤倒是还有正常留守着的。训练用长枪说不上锐利，戳在木头靶子上都扎不进多少。但或许正因如此才能模拟和势大力沉的怪物相撞吧"}
{"time": 1772678689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236364907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1850600424]“哎，那个上位猎人明知道那里的轰龙的巢穴，怎么不带你们撤退，还要去招惹一下？”你的养母皱起了眉头“队长应该优先保证队伍安全才对吧？”"}
{"time": 1772678759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1716739325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“不造啊，我也觉得有点莫名其妙”"}
{"time": 1772678815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629176400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#提起这个也是皱了皱眉头"}
{"time": 1772678833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013571402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“没劝住，不过其实我们也可以不参与。”"}
{"time": 1772678873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801427828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1331085919]你挥汗如雨好一阵，手都有些抬不起来了。在重量上训练用长枪可不掺丝毫水分。你终于歇息的时候，下意识地看了看观战席"}
