{"time": 1772681608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361904897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=66704429]“哦……照相机？”养父点点头“是有，近几年才流行起来的”"}
