{"time": 1772681652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "62642020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;兴奋&#93;,file=85-859ffd1075f53c2068aee8c4b4f3f030.gif,url=https://gxh.vip.qq.com/club/item/parcel/item/85/859ffd1075f53c2068aee8c4b4f3f030/raw300.gif,key=398625738c6b011a,emoji_id=859ffd1075f53c2068aee8c4b4f3f030,emoji_package_id=209658]"}
{"time": 1772681703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363131735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=680144428]#“传说中古龙确实存在智慧”有些愣的顺着了她的前面的话“不过我没见过，说不准去拜访他们就能叽里呱啦的交流了”"}
{"time": 1772681818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784982832", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“丝诺莎，有机会的话，要不要和我一起去外地旅行”"}
{"time": 1772682198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507870310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1784982832]“旅行……”丝诺莎抬起头看着你“有机会的话”她点了点头，又摇了摇头“可是大家都会很麻烦吧”"}
{"time": 1772682249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529549340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“我想和爸妈拍张照，这样不就能永远留着了？”"}
{"time": 1772682287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844880397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=322656046]“这样”养父点了点头“倒也不错，不过我一个人可弄不了，对吧”"}
{"time": 1772682378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323423385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1507870310]“只要丝诺莎在我身边，我就不会觉得有任何累的，不过这也要和雪诺哥商量一下呢，为此我必须可以为你遮蔽风雨”"}
{"time": 1772682418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800137791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=363131735]“哇哦，拜访古龙。这算你特有的幽默感吗？”雷吉娅娜翻了个白眼“先不说我不打算这么快去送死，到时候它怎么和你交流，用爪子在地上写字？”"}
