{"time": 1772803882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766985899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "（我只要反击就好了，反正多刷技能又没有XP）"}
{"time": 1772803888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263250652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=961142868] 咱们开个群继续吗）"}
{"time": 1772803894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1228903551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（以后遇到不能反击的远程技能就知错了）"}
{"time": 1772803897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "30975656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。log off"}
{"time": 1772830980, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1049423943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "继续记录乐谱"}
{"time": 1772831042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "866410324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你翻一下吧）"}
{"time": 1772831067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122380059", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974535321]"}
{"time": 1772831301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688344086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1974535321]朝西北方向前进少许，冰川融水终于出现一处滞留。明镜般的湖泊倒映着晴空，有一种搅动水面就能把天空一起搅动的错觉"}
{"time": 1772831383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1365700767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想怕不怕冷的事情，想了想还是避免失温吧。)"}
{"time": 1772831405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729213991", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "远方，雪线看起来离这边还有6、7公里。胆小又没什么竞争心的低等怪物被压缩在这片区域"}
{"time": 1772831530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2114466755", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿着相机拍下来，难得的好天气，摘掉手套伸手搅碎湖水，语气略带天真，\"里昂先生，雪线往上会有什么怪物?\"停了一会，指着最高处的雪山，\"山顶呢？\""}
{"time": 1772831838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920263966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“雪线往上基本都是些难缠的家伙了。白兔兽这种级别的自不用说”里昂警戒着周围和水体“霜翼风漂龙挺喜欢这边的，再往北似乎有些太冷了，冰牙龙更喜欢那边一点……还有和民房一样大的巨兽。也不知道那些怪物为什么偏偏要生活在那么冷的地方”"}
{"time": 1772831873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787023579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“山顶，大概没有生物会喜欢栖息在那里吧。除了冰雪以外什么都没有的地方”"}
{"time": 1772832045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608869433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"和自己在课本上看到的差不多，慢慢开口，\"既然这些生物会生活在这里，肯定有自然的原因...我想做的...就是查清这些!\"眼睛亮闪闪地看着湖面，收回有些冻红的手，\"接下来一段还要麻烦里昂先生啦。\"起身往前。"}
{"time": 1772832055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "333763147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我是碍事梨?)"}
{"time": 1772832080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270869885", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实我没有玩过任何一作生化危机（））"}
{"time": 1772832143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737795507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过我确实也想知道）"}
{"time": 1772832170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587237226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（比如，大跨度丘陵山脉这种地形）"}
{"time": 1772832241, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388299178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（植物也便算了，为什么这种有退路可以走的地形，有生物不选择往海拔更低点的地方去呢）"}
{"time": 1772832250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990695020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然资源肯定是要考虑的）"}
{"time": 1772832309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018328848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有天敌倒是可以解释，但是山顶也有掠食者的情况下，挺……神奇的）"}
{"time": 1772832330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "246000405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(答案是，冻峰龙)"}
{"time": 1772832371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827300837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不过硬要说的话，只能说，可能怪猎自有国情在此吧。)"}
{"time": 1772832897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798256496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "绕过湖泊，里昂和你一起继续往前，左手没离开过腰间的刀柄。几头眠狗龙在外围一些的地方虎视眈眈，但似乎遵守着某种约定俗成的规律，没有袭击水源附近的草食种"}
{"time": 1772832973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026229415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过很快这几头贼眉鼠眼的家伙也就作鸟龙散了。因为一头痹毒龙踱着步从雪线之上而来"}
{"time": 1772833081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702554581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"看向里昂先生，虽然自己自然是没有在这个地方交手的打算，但手还是搭在腰间的剑柄上，\"里昂先生有狩猎的把握吗？\""}
{"time": 1772833265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338949710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“大家伙啊……”里昂摇了摇头“道具带的不多，打起来很难讨好”"}
{"time": 1772833290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400239829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（寒带有毒的几乎也就这一位了吧）"}
{"time": 1772833427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037221561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(有毒的本身也就)"}
{"time": 1772833431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没几个啊)"}
{"time": 1772833446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655527678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(但是我要说了，那有些飞龙在哪都很正常。)"}
{"time": 1772833508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "18899657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（雪山真没火龙（））"}
{"time": 1772833520, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182814870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"摇摇头，松开手，\"那就离开吧，虽然不知道它为什么会从雪线上下来...不过看来雪山在提醒我，不要过度深入了。\"慢慢后退，尽量不惊动远方的痹毒。"}
{"time": 1772833532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784366188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我说的其实是棘茶)"}
{"time": 1772833540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376826960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（呃）"}
{"time": 1772833547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1660117443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1772833632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1706579453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "实际上，痹毒龙倒也没怎么管你们。偷感很重地来到湖泊旁，喝上两口就要警惕地抬起头来看一眼周围的情况"}
{"time": 1772833725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "659887542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "转身准备离开之前，看这家伙的状态，想来附近还有什么其他的大型怪物，四处环视看看，没什么动静的话就准备下山，\"这一路麻烦里昂先生了。\""}
{"time": 1772833814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2004220348", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来没什么理会我们的打算啊。”里昂点点头“天色也不早了，说起来……”"}
{"time": 1772833820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769895821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以过个侦查）"}
{"time": 1772833952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995970020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+2"}
{"time": 1772833952, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1995970020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上真由理]演奏出: 1D20+2={5}+2=7"}
{"time": 1772833962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088310996", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\""}
{"time": 1772833998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638041391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "正在给痹毒龙拍照片，微微偏过脑袋看向里昂，等着下文。"}
{"time": 1772834122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1046648222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他朝着远方，比雪山主峰稍低一些的地方投去视线“差不多就是昨天这个时候，轰龙出洞觅食来着”"}
{"time": 1772834198, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900348247", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我们可得快点离开。\"有些印证了自己的猜想，放下相机，抱起白一步做两步下山。"}
{"time": 1772834289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454569240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "那你们很快踏上返程的路，恰好也赶上痹毒龙的返程"}
{"time": 1772834340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2020457335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "稍微回头看看，也就不再继续看下去，快步下山。"}
{"time": 1772834370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "442439294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(和这种牙龙没什么好说的)"}
{"time": 1772834377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "352098859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉不如，冰牙大人)"}
{"time": 1772834500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1516557644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而轰龙，不知道是不是规律作息的缘故，的确从山腰腾空而起。在夕阳最后的余晖下，尽力展开的翼膜和那比其他飞龙粗壮一圈的头颅组成颇有野性的三角构图，乘着寒风俯冲而下。只不过方向和你们所在的几乎可以称为粮仓的地方相差十万八千里"}
{"time": 1772834512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123235522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "似乎是往东去了"}
{"time": 1772834751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "103696188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "举起相机准备抓拍，\"啧!\"最后只得到了有些糊的照片，遗憾地收回手，\"不知道那家伙会去哪...\"使劲晃晃脑袋，重新收拾好心情，\"不过得感谢吸引了它注意的东西呢。\"把相机放到白的怀里，伸个懒腰。"}
{"time": 1772834938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331795625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之你们回到了哨所附近，路上倒是没什么意外。人们的晚饭时间也到了，山林里零零星星地升起几十簇炊烟"}
{"time": 1772835090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1741444874", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "和这里的猎人打个招呼，感谢里昂先生的陪同，\"我是安...之后有事可以在研究所找我。\"不打算在这里打扰别人晚饭的清闲时间，抱起白，倒也不在意能不能准时吃到晚饭，在余晖里朝着村子慢慢走，\"嗯...白说，跟着安是不是会很无聊...?\""}
{"time": 1772835402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504157257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喵？”白抱着相机，晃晃悠悠地抬头看你“白觉得很舒服喵~什么也不用担心，在哪里都可以轻松喵……只是，有时候不知道安想要白做什么喵？”"}
{"time": 1772835636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751854987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（今晚就该做梦了（）"}
{"time": 1772835641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485380772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（希望你灵感过关）"}
{"time": 1772835676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316441176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...因为，安自己也不知道安可以做什么吧...\"低头看着腰间的剑，自嘲地笑了笑，\"说是不适合用剑，其实是逃避的借口...说是乖乖女...其实叛逆地不选择一样的道路...\"停顿，小声自言自语，\"说不定，安一直是任性，叛逆的坏孩子吧。\""}
{"time": 1772835692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438009765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(和猫剖析心路ing)"}
{"time": 1772836005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47419818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "艾露猫的眼睛睁得大大的，耳朵抖了抖，听了半天，若有所思，最后摇了摇小脑袋“没完全听懂喵……白不知道，但是白觉得，安不是坏人喵”"}
{"time": 1772836078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1870987833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（猫听不懂的啦，猫只会背着它和你的那一点点家当跟着你满世界跑）"}
{"time": 1772836240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377771319", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "揉乱白头顶的毛发，\"呼...嘛，抱歉，是我自说自话啦，白一直都做得很好。\"手指敲敲它怀里的相机，\"我要检查有没有好好拍下我的照片哦?\""}
{"time": 1772836262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366223585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我还以为要说这一点点就是它的全世界这样的话了。)"}
{"time": 1772836283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415241789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我原本是打算说差不多的话的）"}
{"time": 1772836296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "70544199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是也太快了，这才刚见面不到一周（）"}
