{"time": 1773040704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663978176", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“临清，这是我们合力干掉的第一只飞龙”"}
{"time": 1773040709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133941239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“跟扒了毛过了热水的肉鸡一样”"}
{"time": 1773040720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034799003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“我们也算是合格的猎人了”"}
{"time": 1773040726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "495640170", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#双刀戳戳"}
{"time": 1773040730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190255237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（雷狼龙护甲给我的自信）"}
{"time": 1773040745, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547518797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“凝雪”"}
{"time": 1773040788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1312764967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“下次我让你去吸引注意的时候最好努力攻击，你拿的肉干对他们而言根本没有太大的吸引力”"}
{"time": 1773040805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922933030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "从雪线附近回村的安从白手里拿回相机——现在自然也看不出什么来。希望学会里有洗相片的暗房"}
{"time": 1773040847, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582186801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“当我受到危急生命的攻击时你要对伙伴做的事情无非两件”"}
{"time": 1773040875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1330531872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“1.及时给伙伴治疗 2.让对方被迫转移火力”"}
{"time": 1773040915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1521768957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“如果有爆桶，你可以点燃引信后把它推过去及时跑开”"}
{"time": 1773040971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697311932", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“如果有火油箭，你则可以试着点燃它”"}
{"time": 1773041003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "847336146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“你要想好对龙而言能吸引注意力的是什么。”"}
{"time": 1773041010, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554507375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1034799003]临清跳起来和你击掌“长翅膀的大家伙也不过如此喵”"}
{"time": 1773041024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023311407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=847336146]（是人吧可能（））"}
{"time": 1773041040, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203780124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1554507375][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “是哒，喵”#抱着临清转一圈，推车子回去了"}
{"time": 1773041052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "671206038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“危险的对手或是更有价值猎物”"}
{"time": 1773041075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925911632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“就比如你拿的肉干，我们吃的对他们来说也不过是塞牙缝”"}
{"time": 1773041089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328892732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然不急着洗照片，先带着白去食堂用餐。"}
{"time": 1773041098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539953256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“你得拿一头波波那么大的肉，才能吸引他的注意力。”"}
{"time": 1773041114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "161023206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "当然，用完餐就去冲洗照片。"}
{"time": 1773041126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1249164078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“你猜猜如果我要吸引你的注意力，会拿出什么？”"}
{"time": 1773041273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "456646763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1249164078]“木天蓼喵？”凝雪听了半天，这才回到自己擅长的领域"}
{"time": 1773041287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837520256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“答对了。”"}
