{"time": 1773048915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1686826587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=17917810]当然并不在。一望无际的原野上只有你，还有那被大致成螺旋状的稀疏云迹点缀的天空"}
{"time": 1773048973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "191091427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=220508340]“行不行啊你？”雷吉娅娜站到你旁边，撇了撇嘴“你要是再回去躺一天还练不练了”"}
{"time": 1773049114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453326507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "#“啊哈哈.......”有些尴尬的笑了笑“如果雷吉亚纳小姐愿意的话，务必帮我一把”"}
{"time": 1773049221, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175438132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#简单的和凝雪吃完之后，去哨所看看"}
{"time": 1773049229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181585050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#自然是带上武器和新的护甲"}
{"time": 1773049261, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1616743039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=867322806]你在路上和推着小木板车的养母碰了面，看起来这个点驻军们也吃完了晚饭。\n她自然也空不出手来牵着你，只是和你点点头“塔莉娅，今天怎么样？我看你一早就出了门”"}
{"time": 1773049263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "598140239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1686826587]自己应该不会单独出门，在湖边慢慢坐下，脱掉鞋袜，把小腿以下小心地浸没进湖面中。"}
{"time": 1773049352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315107841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“委托顺利完成，嗯....体验了点不一样的东西。”"}
