{"time": 1773050166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143006545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...\"皱了皱眉，水里有什么东西的样子，不过想到只是在做梦，害怕的情绪消散，站起身，淌着水往湖中心走。"}
{"time": 1773050169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368017401", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那还不错。”"}
