{"time": 1773113145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "523303845", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=235979660]#看着板车，发现不是伤员也是松了口气"}
{"time": 1773113146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714059706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1019807939]\"唔?\"抓了抓自己蓬乱的头发，俨然还没一副睡醒的样子。坐在床上眨了眨眼，\"艾希感兴趣的话，其他几张也看看嘛。\""}
{"time": 1773113146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "492147333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=235979660]#自己紧紧装备，和他们打个招呼“”那个方向情况怎么样"}
{"time": 1773113161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "125051095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#顺便问问哨所的大致情况"}
{"time": 1773113165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632049051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（突然发现个事）"}
{"time": 1773113175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1846420593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=998915597]“呼唔……相片，真神奇。这是哪儿？啊，安你醒了？昨天去那么漂亮的地方，怎么不叫我？”艾希缩回了脖子，不过看得出来还是有些向往"}
{"time": 1773113182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "638318398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“那边的分哨所情况如何?”"}
{"time": 1773113183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712411534", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（只要伏黑惠不去送人头，宿傩破不了无下限）"}
{"time": 1773113397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990861778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跳下床，清醒了不少。\"嗯哼?毕竟很闲嘛，导师也没管我去哪，今天要不要一起去看看?\"把相片拿起来，塞到她手里，\"喏，还有拍的怪物照片。\""}
{"time": 1773113463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342140364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在压力倒是都不大啦”推车的猎人和你们打着招呼“集会所给的报酬也不少，我都想谢谢轰龙了……那两个哨所的主要职责其实是帮第一防线补漏”"}
{"time": 1773113566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285040762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "“好👌🏻”"}
{"time": 1773113787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943585399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1990861778]“今天？好哦，相机还在你那里吗？”艾希闻言翻着其他的照片“现在的情况也挺少见的，凯莉导师应该也会同意我去长长见识吧”"}
