{"time": 1773151461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752568844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "只见那充满力量感的身姿再次腾空跃起，背靠着北方远处不知何时暗下来的天空，宛若恐惧的使者一般"}
{"time": 1773151499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1315340157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"拉着艾希立刻后退，\"快走!\""}
