{"time": 1773152306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138578230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1848196659]“什么，袭击？”雷吉娅娜顺着你的目光看过去，自然不会看漏那根狼烟“那是什么？”"}
