{"time": 1773317180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "521957603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说是双刀，但是如果按猎人身高1m8来算的话，双刀刃长也有个近1m了）"}
