{"time": 1773628126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608921928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1505686394]\"嗯...\"虽然自己也不太确定，但出声安慰着她，\"没事的，不会有什么东西对我们感兴趣的。\"呼口气，\"安静的原因肯定是因为轰龙啦，轰龙啦。\"皱眉看着天空，往山下退。"}
{"time": 1773628188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "297098077", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "轰龙的第二轮咆哮，较之之前只强不弱。音波压低草木，还夹杂着刚进食完特有的血腥气。你毫不怀疑这一声如果在雪山上吼出来，绝对会引发雪崩"}
{"time": 1773628191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371654410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=C3C50A85E578A20D07C3361C410B3750.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhStpRfN5l3g13dsN8wHmhaBWFwAaBiPlE0g_woo-vny8a-jkwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQM7bFp43nPBMhkGrbBrJ4F3oCGWKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMPJIAxchtPIUYG-HxbXftwiS3RXXh8BFScqKcrFsiCResNzCOHZBGsArdzHH_Bojow,file_size=1264143]"}
