{"time": 1773837697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070067590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“你不会有事的，不然我可要吃你的零食，欺负你的凝雪了，你的父母也要哭的”"}
{"time": 1773837708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1401594566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#握着她的手，希望可以激发求生欲"}
