{"time": 1773839413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062496200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我到场先看尸体吗？那我还是别到场了。)"}
{"time": 1773839453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742929510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（乐）"}
{"time": 1773839484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090896195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#专业的人接手后，黑楼退到一边，不过还是垫着脚尖看着"}
{"time": 1773839495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "308595916", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "轰龙没有回头理会。它试图腾飞，不知道为什么没能成功，距离倒是真的越拉越大。队长的速度渐渐慢了下来，无望地看着轰龙远去的方向，最后也只能灰溜溜地退回来，雨水顺着他的枪尖滴下，沉默得像铁"}
{"time": 1773839577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482174590", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1090896195]现在下着大雨，暂时没法转移回村中，只得先在营地内安置着"}
{"time": 1773839614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266414304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "#自己寸步不离的守着，咬着嘴唇，就算咬破了也不知道"}
{"time": 1773839633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901258654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(算是欠黑楼一条命了.jpg)"}
{"time": 1773839668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1677029008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2062496200]另一边的安，只看见轰龙从林间重新来到平原上，几次试图起飞，但就好像剪了羽毛的鸟一般，怎么都飞不高"}
{"time": 1773839704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2101216499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么好像都在欠他命，吗）"}
{"time": 1773839751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983322220", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "（怎么好像都在欠他命，吗）"}
{"time": 1773839786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910509013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "知道袭击已经结束，那也没必要赶去那边添乱。暂且停下脚步饶有兴趣地继续观察，轰龙确实是飞龙，吗？"}
{"time": 1773839822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1899279162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1266414304]自然是有医生处理着。灯火把针的影子投在帐篷上，下沉又上浮，有点像另一种心跳"}
{"time": 1773839917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2053780132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(我是不是目前以来伤的最重的一个)"}
{"time": 1773839925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1853285271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "“要活着呀，你还欠我很多药剂，我还要坑你很多顿饭菜才行”"}
{"time": 1773839942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "726962257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(还有蹭饭王)"}
