{"time": 1773840877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1560935937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=462004504]那么本来就疲惫的看守们神经质般地抬头，对着几乎已经入夜的天空看了好一会，又神经质般地低头"}
{"time": 1773840934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1446163119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1560935937]“没特别近……但也没特别远。”雷吉娅娜也盯着看了一会“真烦人”"}
{"time": 1773841045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "433150929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2115291629]“不是说这个。”医生拿起一条湿毛巾盖在自己的眼睛上“我们会有人看着的。但是你的身体状况也是我们的工作内容”"}
{"time": 1773841098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800161693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=832558701]站在地面仔细观察，反正上面的家伙肯定也注意不到自己。拿出随身的相机准备记录。"}
{"time": 1773841122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045749983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是拍不清楚"}
{"time": 1773841148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179962988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "除非那家伙的海拔再下降两百米"}
{"time": 1773841164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63581969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1085444390"}, "sender": {"id": "1085444390", "name": "Accelerator"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=433150929]“。。。嗯，我知道了”#自己也没有犟，不给他们填麻烦，去稍微休息一下"}
{"time": 1773841259, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189423854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收起相机站在原地再等一会，如果没什么动静就准备回去了。"}
{"time": 1773841295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1246607197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "961142868"}, "sender": {"id": "961142868", "name": "不会在的人"}, "message": "“暂时还是先撤退比较好，如果被波及，会很危险”"}
{"time": 1773841301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373084000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=189423854]确实没什么动静"}
{"time": 1773841334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1670587508", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "#呼吸尽管微弱，却也逐渐变得规律"}
{"time": 1773841401, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516067550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "那就走呗。回去的路上在之前路过两次，梦见过一次的湖边停一下，伸手挽一挽湖水看看。"}
{"time": 1773841423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814306132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(话说，17暴击是限时还是永久)"}
{"time": 1773841458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275907369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（当然是限时）"}
{"time": 1773841472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209622223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(哎呀呀)"}
{"time": 1773841492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "309197495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(彳亍口巴)"}
{"time": 1773841561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1066998745", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1246607197]“撤退……”守卫有些无言“撤去哪，这儿不能没人守着。轰龙都见识过了，就算是古龙来袭也……”"}
{"time": 1773841624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1970738985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "2275904091"}, "sender": {"id": "2275904091", "name": "冰黎曦"}, "message": "(难道，他真的是乌鸦嘴)"}
