{"time": 1773841700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911225261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1066998745]那么就在这时候"}
{"time": 1773841712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "616861795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "村子的方向跑来一个人.jpg"}
{"time": 1773841775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1018556476", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1514060407]\"...\"眨眨眼睛，只是错觉吧?蹲下身子盯着湖面。"}
{"time": 1773841844, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073579883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1018556476]那种感觉一驱而散，好像一场梦，醒了就再找不回感觉"}
{"time": 1773841901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703893945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=616861795]手里似乎拿着什么文件，进了指挥的营帐，过了没多久又匆匆往隔壁防线去了"}
{"time": 1773842047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21874548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不置可否，只当是没休息好的错觉，伸手盛一手水洒向远方。起身伸个懒腰不紧不慢地往村子走。"}
{"time": 1773842224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606411694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1141869747", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=63581969]那么这边就先休息着了。尽管心里有所担心，但是疲惫感压倒性地占优势"}
